<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 4.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.12 pct		6.15 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.01 pct		7.05 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price    100.00		100.30</p>
<p>    Total bids	  6.668 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    4.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are for a previous auction on January 30 of the third tranche of January 1, 2004 CCTs.</p>
</text>
